<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>				  3-mths	  6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 11.50 /11.40  11.825 /11.725  12.25 /12.10</p>
<p>BPI			 11.60 /11.45  12.00  /11.80   12.50 /12.25</p>
<p>Citibank		  11.60 /11.5   11.925 /11.825  12.315/12.215</p>
<p>Metrobank		 11.70 /11.55  12.00  /11.85   12.375/12.25</p>
<p>PNB			 11.525/11.425 11.9   /11.775  12.40 /12.25</p>
<p>Solidbank		 11.65 /11.575 11.90  /11.825  12.30 /12.225</p>
<p>StandChart		11.55 /11.45  11.90  /11.80   12.3  /12.20</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
